# ─── Materials & user data — NEVER commit ────────────────────────────
# No measurement or project data leaves the machine: the app's data dir,
# every project store (.latos, incl. its DB / arrays / synthesis params /
# pre-registration records), and raw instrument files. Unpublished
# materials data must never reach the remote.
data/
**/.latos/
~/.latos/
# generated stores
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.parquet
# raw instrument / measurement exports
*.xrdml
*.emsa
*.spx
*.rasx

