docs/figures/latos_architecture*

# ─── Local research notes and simulation studies ─────────────────────
# Working documents: experiment planning, literature notes, study material,
# lab templates, and the simulation harnesses behind them. Useful locally,
# not part of the shipped package.
#
# `docs/*` rather than `docs/`: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, so ignoring the directory outright would make every
# future edit to the nine tracked docs invisible in `git status` — including
# the per-stage writeups that docs/README.md asks for after each stage. The
# negations below keep exactly those visible.
docs/*
!docs/README.md
!docs/THESIS_OUTLINE.md
!docs/glossary.md
!docs/references.md
!docs/stages/
!docs/figures/

studies/

# ─── Desktop app (apps/desktop — Tauri + React) ──────────────────────
node_modules/
apps/desktop/dist/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
# The Python `lib/` rule above (build artifacts) also matches the app's
# source dir apps/desktop/src/lib/ — the API client + shared helpers. Those
# are source, not build output; keep them tracked.
!apps/desktop/src/lib/

